## QuickMT / CTranslate2

Native Japanese-to-English translation supports the `quickmt/quickmt-ja-en`
model, distributed under CC BY 4.0. The model is loaded with the MIT-licensed
CTranslate2 runtime through the MIT-licensed `ct2rs` bindings. QuickMT model
files are installed separately and are not committed to this repository. Keep
the model card and attribution from <https://huggingface.co/quickmt/quickmt-ja-en>
with redistributed model artifacts.

